{"id":"wb-1-76","name":"海宝塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"海宝塔","text":"海宝塔，旧称黑宝塔、赫宝塔，位于中华人民共和国宁夏回族自治区银川市，因地处银川市北而被俗称为“北塔”，与承天寺塔（西塔）相并称。银川文物部门勘探海宝塔后，推断海宝塔建于北朝到隋唐年间。该塔曾被地震多次损毁甚至震塌，现所存塔已非初建的形制。1961年，海宝塔被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B5%B7%E5%AE%9D%E5%A1%94","revisionId":95389339,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95389339","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/74bac3fd1679c6239089aae3.jpg","title":"海宝塔.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B5%B7%E5%AE%9D%E5%A1%94.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/23/%E6%B5%B7%E5%AE%9D%E5%A1%94.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"霧島聖","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"海宝塔全景照","width":320,"height":432}}